{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adautils\/environmentkey"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Associated Types","anchor":"Associated-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey\/Value"],"generated":true},{"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey\/defaultValue"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentKey"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can create custom environment values by extending the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentValues","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" structure with new properties."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"First declare a new environment key type and specify a value for the required defaultValue property:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["private struct MyEnvironmentKey: EnvironmentKey {","    static let defaultValue: String = \"Default value\"","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then use the key to define a new environment value property:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["extension EnvironmentValues {","    var myCustomValue: String {","        get { self[MyEnvironmentKey.self] }","        set { self[MyEnvironmentKey.self] = newValue }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragrap